        "body": {
          "keyword": "小耳朵"
        }
      },
      "description": "# [中文]\n### 用途:\n- 按抖音号或抖音昵称搜索直播间（V2 版本），支持游标翻页。\n- 适合定位某个主播的直播间，而不是按内容关键词泛搜直播。\n\n### 备注:\n- `keyword` 匹配的是主播的抖音号或昵称，传入内容类关键词（如 \"游戏\"）通常匹配不到结果。\n- 本接口不支持排序、发布时间、时长等筛选条件。\n- 每页固定 10 条，不支持指定数量。\n- 首次请求 `cursor` 传 0，翻页时传上一页响应里返回的 `cursor`。\n\n### 参数:\n- keyword: 抖音号 或 抖音昵称（必填），如 \"小耳朵\"\n- cursor: 翻页游标（首次请求传 0）\n\n### 请求体示例：\n```json\npayload = {\n    \"keyword\": \"小耳朵\",\n    \"cursor\": 0\n}\n```\n\n### 返回（部分常用字段，实际返回字段更多，一切以实际响应为准）:\n- 匹配的直播间列表，每项包含主播昵称、抖音号、头像、直播间ID及开播状态等\n- 翻页信息（下一页的 `cursor`、是否还有更多数据）\n\n# [English]\n### Purpose:\n- Search live rooms by Douyin ID or nickname (V2), with cursor pagination.\n- Best suited for locating a specific streamer's live room rather than searching live\n  content by topic keyword.\n\n### Notes:\n- `keyword` matches the streamer's Douyin ID or nickname; a content keyword (e.g., \"games\")\n  usually returns no result.\n- This endpoint has no sorting, publish time or duration filters.\n- Page size is fixed at 10 and cannot be changed.\n- Set `cursor` to 0 for the first request, then pass the `cursor` from the previous response.\n\n### Parameters:\n- keyword: Douyin ID or nickname (required), e.g., \"小耳朵\"\n- cursor: Pagination cursor (0 for the first request)\n\n### Request Body Example:\n```json\npayload = {\n    \"keyword\": \"小耳朵\",\n    \"cursor\": 0\n}\n```\n\n### Response (common fields, actual response may contain more fields):\n- Matched live room list; each item contains the streamer's nickname, Douyin ID, avatar,\n  room ID and live status\n- Pagination info (next `cursor`, whether more results are available)",
